<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>New man of new creation,</l><l>Born through her risen Lord,</l><l>Baptized in God the Spirit,</l><l>Made holy by His Word;</l><l>Christ is her life and content,</l><l>Himself her glorious Head;</l><l>She has ascended with Him</l><l>O’er all her foes to tread.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ is her one foundation,</l><l>None other man may lay;</l><l>All that she has, as Christ, is</l><l>Divine in every way;</l><l>Her members through the Spirit</l><l>Their death on Calv’ry own;</l><l>They’re built in resurrection—</l><l>Gold, silver, precious stone.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>One God, one Lord, one Spirit—</l><l>Her elements all one—</l><l>One faith, one hope, one baptism,</l><l>One Body in the Son;</l><l>The triune God is in her,</l><l>One Body members own,</l><l>By faith they are united,</l><l>In hope of glory shown.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>From every tribe and nation</l><l>Do all the members come,</l><l>Regardless of their classes</l><l>United to be one.</l><l>No high there is, nor lowly,</l><l>No Jew, nor Gentile clan,</l><l>No free, nor slave, nor master,</l><l>But Christ, the “one new man.”</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>One Body universal,</l><l>One in each place expressed;</l><l>Locality of dwelling</l><l>Her only ground possessed;</l><l>Administration local,</l><l>Each answ’ring to the Lord;</l><l>Communion universal,</l><l>Upheld in one accord.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Her local gatherings model</l><l>The New Jerusalem;</l><l>Its aspects and its details</l><l>Must show in all of them.</l><l>Christ is the Lamp that shineth,</l><l>With God within, the Light;</l><l>They are the lampstands bearing</l><l>His glorious Image bright.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
